Human Stability Infrastructure Licensing

This repository uses different licenses for different kinds of material.

Documentation and other non-code material
-----------------------------------------

Unless a file clearly states otherwise, original written documentation and other non-code material in this repository are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

Role files, templates, and worked examples are text documents and are treated as non-code material, even when used as prompts in software.

The complete license text is in:

LICENSE-DOCS.md

Software code
-------------

Software source code, when code is added to this repository and identified as software, is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 unless a specific file clearly states otherwise.

The complete license text is in:

LICENSE-CODE.md

Trademarks and project identity
-------------------------------

These licenses do not grant trademark rights or permission to imply sponsorship, certification, endorsement, official partnership, or authorship.

See:

TRADEMARKS.md

Third-party material
--------------------

Third-party material remains subject to its own license and rights. Nothing in this file changes those terms.

If a specific file contains its own license notice, that file-specific notice controls for that file.
